# Rebuild firmware after rmk/ changes

After any edit under `rmk/` (keymap, config, Cargo, source, `vial.json`, etc.), rebuild before considering the task done.

```bash
cd rmk && cargo make fast
```

Use the fast profile for compile checks (~8s keymap edits vs ~14s release). Before flashing or shipping, build the release UF2:

```bash
cd rmk && cargo make uf2 --release
```

For a quick flashable build during iteration (larger binary than release):

```bash
cd rmk && cargo make uf2-fast
```

Do not wait for the user to ask. If the build fails, fix it and rebuild.
